+- Superseded: the 2026-09-15 decision required `@container` queries on `.shell` and forbade viewport `@media` width
+  queries (`min-width` / `max-width`).
+- Known risk (original reason): the shell renders inside split panes as narrow as 380px on a 1440px screen. Viewport
+  queries pick the two-column layout inside a narrow pane and clip the sidebar (incident 2026-09-14). The override
+  accepts this.
